┌ Chats ───────────┐┌ Book club ───────────────────────────┐┌ People ──────────┐
│#┌ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│@│/servers              see your servers and whether each is connected      │ │
│#│/forget <number>      delete a server and its rooms from this computer    │ │
│ │/mute                 hide this room's new-message count                  │ │
│ │/unmute               show this room's new-message count again            │ │
│ │/details              see this room's admins, size and age                │ │
│ │/settings             see this room's settings                            │ │
│ │/settings invite      admins or anyone: who can bring people in (admins)  │ │
│ │/settings slow        seconds or off: how long members wait between       │ │
│ │                      messages (admins)                                   │ │
│ │/settings topic       admins or anyone: who can set the topic (admins)    │ │
│ │/clear                delete this room's messages from this computer      │ │
│ │/theme [name]         see or change the colors: phosphor or classic       │ │
│ │/mouse [on|off]       turn mouse clicks and scrolling on or off           │ │
│ │/updates [on|off]     turn the daily check for a new version on or off    │ │
│ │/about                see the version and what Socketchat is              │ │
│ │/quit                 close Socketchat                                    │ │
│ │Up/Down               bring back your earlier lines in this room          │ │
└─│                                                                          │─┘
┌─│To select text while the mouse is on, hold Shift as you drag (Option or Fn│─┐
│ │on a Mac), or type /mouse off.                                            │s│
